### Layer 4: 통합 대시보드 계층 (100줄)
**DashboardLayer - L-Dashboard Facade**

**구성 요소**:
```
DashboardLayer {
    prometheus_registry: PrometheusRegistry,
    alert_manager: AlertManager,
    grafana_dashboard: GrafanaDashboard,
    enabled: bool,
    auto_refresh: bool,
}
```

**주요 API**:
```
pub fn new() -> Self
pub fn update_metrics(&mut self, metrics: &GrafanaPanelMetrics)
pub fn check_alerts(&mut self, metric: &str, value: f64)
pub fn export_prometheus(&self) -> String
pub fn export_dashboard_json(&self) -> String
pub fn get_summary(&self) -> DashboardReport
```

**통합 보고서**:
```
DashboardReport {
    dashboard_name: String,
    total_panels: 4,
    total_metrics: 49,
    alert_rules: 10,
    active_alerts: usize,
    enabled: bool,
    auto_refresh: bool,
}
```

**테스트**: 5개 ✅

